  "title": {
   "en": "Mukuware Nakatta Murabito A, Kizoku ni Hirowarete Dekiaisareru Ue ni, Jitsu wa Motteita Densetsu-kyuu no Kami Skill mo Kakusei shita"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "報われなかった村人A、貴族に拾われて溺愛される上に、実は持っていた伝説級の神スキルも覚醒した"
   },
   {
    "en": "Unrequited Villager A is Picked Up by a Nobleman Who Dotes on Him, and in Addition, He Also Awakens the Legendary God Skill He Possessed."
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Everything we do unconsciously changes the world!! Mateo is reincarnated and picked up by a nobleman, who dotes on him and allows his abilities to blossom. He can hatch a dragon egg in an instant and use ancient magic. Hearing rumors of his great magical powers, the emperor comes to investigate, but it turns out that the emperor is actually a girl disguised as a man...!?",
   "ja": "無自覚にやることなすこと全てが世界を変えていく!!　転生し、大貴族に拾われたマテオは、溺愛されながら能力を開花させていく。ドラゴンの卵を一瞬で孵化させたり、古代魔法を使えたり。強大な魔力の噂を聞き皇帝が確かめに来るのだが、その皇帝は実は男装した女の子で…!?"
  },
